OSI Model / TCP-IP: Open System Interconnection: APST - NDP
 - Layer 7 : Application : HTTP/HTTPS, FTP, SMTP, DNS 
 - Layer 6 : Presentation : also known as the syntax layer, ensure data security during transmission
 - Layer 5 : Session : manages and controls the connections between computers (API, Socket)
 - Layer 4 : Transport : TCP, UDP 
 - Layer 3 : Network : 
 - Layer 2 : Data Link : Ethernet
 - Layer 1 : Physical :
TCP-IP:
 - Application Layer (application + presentation + session)
 - Transport Layer (Transport)
 - Internet Layer (Network)
 - Network Access (Data Link + Physical)
